     1635     on error undo, return error
     1636     :
     1637       find first buf_temp-smart-route where
     1638                 buf_temp-smart-route.key-field = p-key-field
     1639             and buf_temp-smart-route.db-num = p-db-num no-error.
     1640       if not available buf_temp-smart-route then do:
