     7502       delete object v-tth no-error.
     7503       run adm/shattri.p (
     7504              input "get":U
     7505             ,input ub.clients.obj-type
     7506             ,input ub.clients.obj-code
     7507             ,input 'gds-ref_obj':U
     7508             ,input 'image-dir':U
